    "motivation": "Mastering General Principles & Processes of Isolation of Elements is absolutely essential for standard physical, inorganic, and organic coordination. In JEE and other competitive national exams, questions are frequently framed connecting Ellingham Diagram to standard thermodynamic and equilibrium boundaries. This chapter builds the intuitive conceptual framework needed to solve multi-step chemical reactions smoothly.",
